# Disk Management & Formatting
lsblk           - Lists disks and partitions
fdisk -l        - Displays disk partition information
parted -l       - Lists disk partition tables
blkid           - Displays filesystem UUIDs and types
fdisk           - Manages disk partitions
parted          - Creates and manages disk partitions
partprobe       - Updates kernel partition information
partx           - Updates partition table information
mkfs            - Creates a filesystem
mkfs.ext4       - Formats a partition with ext4 filesystem
mkfs.xfs        - Formats a partition with XFS filesystem
